data.content:
Build succeeds. Here's what was created:

**Files added:**

1. **`Components/ScreenSize.cs`** — enum with `Mobile`, `Tablet`, `Desktop` values
2. **`Components/ScreenSizeProvider.razor`** — wraps child content in a `<CascadingValue>` named `"ScreenSize"`, defaults to `Desktop`, updates on resize via JS interop
3. **`wwwroot/js/screenSize.js`** — listens to `window.resize`, classifies width into categories, and calls back into .NET

**Usage in child components:**

```razor
@code {
    [CascadingParameter(Name = "ScreenSize")]
    public ScreenSize ScreenSize { get; set; }
}
```

The cascading value updates in real time as the browser is resized.
